# Declaring the alternate-exit routine as hand-written, which must be refused:
# a C body returns to its call site or not at all, and $0330 also returns to
# $031C. Externalizing happens before routines are identified, so by the time
# anything could notice, the body carrying the evidence is gone -- the check has
# to live in the externalizing pass itself.
0330 test_sub
